'''CTO Seal''' (パワハラッコ部長 ''Pawaharakko Buchō'', '''Department Chief Pawaharakko''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Otta-smack-u]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

