==Enemy==
CTO Seal is a well-rounded enemy with a fast attack rate, long range and a 100% chance of [[Freeze|freezing]] Cats with each hit, which is pretty much permafreeze considering his freeze duration is more than 4 times his attack rate. His attack power isn't too high, but he is usually accompanied by enemies with high pushing power, which help him gradually move forward and eventually reach your back line if you're not careful.

==Strategy==
CTO Seal can shut down almost anything with under 380 range, so the most reliable way to defeat him is to steadily chip away at him with ranged attackers, all the while sending out lots of meatshields to ensure that he doesn't push too much. [[Adult Cat (Rare Cat)|Prisoner Cat]] and True Form [[Maiden Cat (Rare Cat)|Maiden Cat]] are good choices, as the former has great range and is strong against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], and the latter is strong against Red and immune to Freeze. [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]] can also possibly get a snipe on it, especially with help of the Thunderbolt Cat Cannon. [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] are both outranged by CTO Seal, so avoid using them.

